WEBVTT

01:06:03.200 --> 01:06:04.492
What?

01:06:04.577 --> 01:06:07.162
Somebody's poisoned the water hole.

01:06:07.246 --> 01:06:11.249
-It's busted.
-Who are you callin' busted, buster?

01:06:12.209 --> 01:06:13.335
That's right.

01:06:13.419 --> 01:06:17.130
I'm talking to you, Sid Phillips.

01:06:17.214 --> 01:06:20.008
We don't like bein' blown up, Sid,

01:06:20.092 --> 01:06:22.052
or smashed or ripped apart.

01:06:22.136 --> 01:06:25.597
-"We"?
-That's right! Your toys!

01:06:26.557 --> 01:06:27.932
Mama!

01:06:28.434 --> 01:06:29.768
Mama!
